How to play:
There are two types of controls:
	-> Free controls;
	-> Fixed controls.

Free Controls: 
	-> The screen is divided in the middle;
	-> Left side of the screen is for movement;
	-> Right side of the screen is for shooting;
	-> Avoid getting your fingers to close to the center of the screen.

Fixed Controls:
	-> Controller on the left side is for movement;
	-> Controller on the right side is for shooting.

Note: Use options menu to adjust which one you wish to use.
